{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c5a718dc572b1952","name":"Jedi Shadow Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-c5a718dc572b1952","title":"Jedi Shadow Talent Tree","revision":19190,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:29:49Z","sha256":"76e91949f13d76ed85bd6b0b3bfcc32b9a8e9705d8477ee291a1a391fd601371","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19190","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Shadow%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c5a718dc572b1952","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Jedi Shadows are often elite ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Sentinels"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Sentinel_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:39bae85f284ce360"}," who specialize in abilities that aid them in pursuing Dark Side users in all forms and locations. These Talents are also utilized by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Covenanters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Covenanters"},".\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Dark Deception"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can cloak your intentions with a veil of anger and hate. When another character attempts to sense you through ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," in any way, you can choose to act as though your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," equals your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," score. Additionally, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," is now a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Class Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Class_Skill"}," for you.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Sentinel Strike"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sentinel Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sentinel_Strike"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Increase the damage dice of your ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sentinel Strike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sentinel_Strike"}]}," to d8, instead of d6.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Improved Sentinel's Gambit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sentinel's Gambit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sentinel%27s_Gambit"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sentinel's Gambit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sentinel%27s_Gambit"}]}," an additional number of times equal to half your Class Level (minimum 1).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Rebuke the Dark"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebuke"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebuke","referenceId":"reference:b729f880ae397e8e"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When using the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebuke"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebuke","referenceId":"reference:b729f880ae397e8e"}]}," Force Power against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor, roll two dice for the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rebuke"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebuke","referenceId":"reference:b729f880ae397e8e"}]}," attempt, keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Taint of the Dark Side"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Dark Deception"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Add one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},". Once per encounter you can use that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," with the [",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side"}]},"] descriptor without increasing your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},". If you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Point"}," to modify this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," in any way, you increase your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"}," as normal.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
